GROUP 7 - CompareContent / MultiRename / NameTemplate          driver: pkg/Fuzz/fuzz-diff/main.swift
Fuzzer: own coverage-guided mutation fuzzer (FuzzCore). "asan" = -O + AddressSanitizer + inline 8-bit edge counters; "rel" = plain -O.
Reproduce: $F/build-rel/release/fuzz-diff run <target> <file> [--timeout S]

