FINDINGS
1. CRASH (overflow trap)  Sources/Plugins/FileOperations/NameTemplate.swift:352  `width = last - start + 1`
   typed text "<[N9223372036854775807--9223372036854775807]": start = Int.max-1, last = count - Int.max -> subtraction overflows.
   repro: repro/diff/nametemplate-slice-overflow.bin       cmd: fuzz-diff run nametemplate repro/diff/nametemplate-slice-overflow.bin
2. CRASH (overflow trap)  Sources/Plugins/FileOperations/NameTemplate.swift:343  `end = start + length - 1`
   typed text "<[N1,-9223372036854775808]": length = Int.min (min($0, 255) keeps negatives) -> 0 + Int.min - 1 overflows.
   repro: repro/diff/nametemplate-slice-length-overflow.bin
   Both: New folder (F7) / New file (Shift+F4) with a text starting with "<"; NameTemplate.names runs inside the job -> trap kills the app.
   Fix: parse positions with a digit limit (as RenameMask.Scanner.number does: at most 9 digits) or clamp to 0...maxWidth / use &+ or addingReportingOverflow; reject negative lengths.
3. HANG  Sources/Plugins/MultiRename/RenameRules.swift:166 (matches(in:)) / :163 (firstMatch), pattern built at :187-196 (wildcardPattern)
   Plain (non-regex) Search "*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*b" against a 250-letter name "aaa...a.a": becomes ^.*?a.*?a...b, which backtracks exponentially; > 60 s per name (never finished), not cancellable (isCancelled is only asked between names).
   repro: repro/diff/renamemask-wildcard-backtracking.bin   cmd: fuzz-diff run renamemask <file> --timeout 60
   Same with a user regular expression "(a*)*b" on 32 a's: repro/diff/renameregex-catastrophic.bin (fuzz-diff run renameregex ...).
   Fix: match wildcards with a linear two-pointer matcher instead of a regex (or collapse to possessive/atomic groups), and run NSRegularExpression through enumerateMatches with a deadline / the cancel flag (stop.pointee = true), reporting <Error!> on timeout.
4. SLOW (bounded)  NameTemplate.swift:284-289: a DateFormatter is built for every [d]/[t] of every name. "<0-99999>[d]" takes 13 s per call of names() (release build) on the job thread. repro/diff/nametemplate-slow-range.bin (--timeout 100). Fix: one formatter per expansion run.
5. PROPERTY (low)  NameTemplate.names: a list part that expands to nothing is returned as an empty name ("<[T2+1D]" -> [""], "<a|[U]" -> ["a", ""]); the range branch (line 65) filters empty names, the list branch (66-78) does not. repro/diff/nametemplate-empty-name.bin with FZ_EMPTY_NAMES=1.
NOT A PRODUCT BUG: RenameMask.swift:499 `context.count - 1` traps for count == Int.min; count is entries.count in the app (repro/diff/note-unrealistic-count.bin is the driver's first, unrealistic input; the driver now keeps count in 0..<3,000,000).

NOT FUZZED: CompareSession (needs a Kernel and the main queue: resync/edit/undo/find on top of the functions above); CompareLoader.load/identical/replace (file-system readers, no parsing of their own beyond TextDocument/BinaryDiff); RenameStore/RenameRun file-system parts; locale- and time-zone-dependent output was run with en_US_POSIX/UTC only.
No patches to the source copy were needed.
